    '/images/destinations/goa/hero.jpg',
    $$Goa is defined by a gentle, tropical rhythm born from four and a half centuries of Portuguese maritime dominion along the sun-drenched Konkan coast. Quite distinct from the rest of the Indian subcontinent, the spirit of Goa - captured in the local philosophy of *susegad* (a relaxed, contented state of mind) - is felt in the rustle of coconut palm fronds, the tolling of white church bells across emerald paddy fields, and the salty breeze blowing in from the Arabian Sea.$$,
