    '/images/destinations/central-india/hero.jpg',
    $$The Central Indian heritage corridor encompasses a majestic cross-section of Indian antiquity. Stretching from the sandstone temple hills of Khajuraho across the medieval fortresses of Orchha to the dense sal forests of Bandhavgarh and Kanha, this is a realm where the boundary between human artistry and primeval nature dissolves entirely.$$,
