    $$10°C - 26°C Day / 4°C - 10°C Night$$,
    $$6 to 9 Days$$,
    $$["Private Sunrise Architectural Tour of the Western Group of Khajuraho: Private, early morning access to the Kandariya Mahadeva and Lakshmana temples with a senior archaeological sch...","Twilight Flute & Sitar Salon at the Orchha Cenotaphs on the River Betwa: Private candlelit reception on the banks of the Betwa River directly facing the illuminated Bundela cenotaphs,...","Private Core-Zone Tiger Tracking in Bandhavgarh with Master Naturalists: Full-day private safari permit across the Tala and Magdhi core zones in an open 4x4 safari vehicle, tracking t...","Dawn Barasingha Safari across Kanha's Maiden Grasslands: Morning game drive across the mist-covered central meadows of Kanha, observing the rare hard-ground barasingha...","Private River Safari on the Ken River Canyon, Panna: Boat expedition through the deep sandstone gorges of the Ken River inside Panna Tiger Reserve, observing nesti..."]$$::jsonb,
    $$["/images/destinations/central-india/hero.jpg","/images/destinations/central-india/khajuraho-temple.jpg","/images/destinations/central-india/orchha-cenotaphs.jpg","/images/destinations/central-india/bandhavgarh-tiger.jpg"]$$::jsonb,
    true
  ),
(
    'tamil-nadu',
    'Tamil Nadu & The Great Living Chola Temples',
    'South India',
    $$Imperial Granite Vimanas, Merchant Palaces & Sacred Classical Arts$$,
    '/images/destinations/tamil-nadu/hero.jpg',
    $$Tamil Nadu is the guardian of unbroken Dravidian civilization. Unlike northern realms whose architectural monuments were repeatedly reshaped by successive waves of conquest, the Cauvery Delta and southern plains of Tamil Nadu have preserved their classical language, ritual temple architecture, and philosophical traditions for more than two millennia. This is an empire of monumental granite, where soaring temple towers (*gopurams*) encrusted with thousands of painted deities dominate the palm-fringed horizon.$$,
    $$November to February (Golden Winter - prime touring climate)$$,
    $$20°C - 30°C$$,
    $$7 to 10 Days$$,
    $$["Private Pre-Dawn VIP Darshan at Brihadisvara Temple, Thanjavur: Curator-led private dawn access to the inner corridors and courtyards of the Great Chola Temple before public ...","Private Twilight Temple Procession at Madurai Meenakshi Temple: Exclusive VIP entry to witness the sacred night procession (*palliyarai*) at the Meenakshi Amman Temple, as th...","Architectural Exploration of Private Chettinad Mansions: Private walking tour of Kanadukathan and Kottaiyur led by a Chettinad heritage conservationist, gaining exclus...","Master Lost-Wax Bronze Casting Masterclass in Swamimalai: Private workshop visit to a 10th-generation master sthapathi family in Swamimalai, observing the creation of b...","Private Chamber Carnatic Veena or Vocal Recital: Intimate evening chamber concert inside the central courtyard of Visalam or Svatma, featuring renowned classic..."]$$::jsonb,
    $$["/images/destinations/tamil-nadu/hero.jpg","/images/destinations/tamil-nadu/thanjavur-temple.jpg","/images/destinations/tamil-nadu/madurai-meenakshi.jpg","/images/destinations/tamil-nadu/chettinad-mansion.jpg"]$$::jsonb,
